erla-mount/","geometry_verified_at":"2026-11-21T00:00:00Z"},"source":{"page_url":"https://karpatskyi-park.in.ua/en/route/hoverla-mount/","gpx_url":"https://karpatskyi-park.in.ua/wp-content/uploads/2021/01/Na-horu-Hoverla-1.gpx","sha256":"df4daddce6ee584e1b96b318e654a86ce31b2c60171dcdcd4904e91aff80024b","creator":"AllTrails.com","points":252,"segments":1,"adaptation":"Coordinates and segment order unchanged. GPX remains hosted by the provider. No timestamps, elevations or waypoint text copied into geometry.","licence_note":"Public download and source conditions reviewed; no new ownership or open-licence claim. Preserve provider attribution and original creator.","time_policy":"none","semantic_sha256":"5a9cfa3e4f29323f62716f1a2014a07c88824bfc65b24f5a2c0fd18b9e48d388"}},{"id":10,"slug":"krivan-tri-studnicky-loop","peak_id":150,"peak_slug":"krivan","before":{"row":{"id":10,"peak_id":150,"slug":"krivan-tri-studnicky-loop","start_point_name":"Tri studni\u010dky","end_point_name":"Tri studni\u010dky","distance_km":null,"elevation_gain_m":1354,"time_min":360,"difficulty":"hard","route_type":"loop","gpx_url":null,"map_url":"https://slovakia.travel/en/the-krivan-mt-the-high-tatras","active":true,"created_at":"2026-10-26T17:54:03.281765+00:00","source_url":null,"last_verified_at":null,"distance_source_url":null,"distance_verified_at":null,"elevation_gain_source_url":"https://slovakia.travel/en/the-krivan-mt-the-high-tatras","elevation_gain_verified_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:23.115226+00:00","time_source_url":"https://slovakia.travel/en/the-krivan-mt-the-high-tatras","time_verified_at":"2026-10-26T20:56:23.115226+00:00","updated_at":"2026-11-15T11:09:57.696191+00:00","route_geometry":null,"geometry_source_url":null,"geometry_verified_at":null},"i18n":[{"lang":"en","name":"Kriv\u00e1\u0148 from Tri studni\u010dky","notes":"Allow approximately 6 hours. The route gains about 1,354 metres of elevation. There are no refreshment or mountain-hut facilities directly on the route. The upper mountain terrain is steep and rocky. Parts of the trail are subject to TANAP seasonal closure.\n\nTime and ascent cover the full circuit returning via Jamsk\u00e9 pleso. Distance remains unverified.","trail_id":10,"description":"A demanding high-mountain loop from Tri studni\u010dky to the summit of Kriv\u00e1\u0148. The route climbs towards Kriv\u00e1\u0148, reaches the 2,494 m summit and descends via Jamsk\u00e9 pleso before returning to Tri studni\u010dky."},{"lang":"pl","name":"Kriv\u00e1\u0148 z Tri studni\u010dky","notes":"Na tras\u0119 nale\u017cy przeznaczy\u0107 oko\u0142o 6 godzin. Przewy\u017cszenie wynosi oko\u0142o 1354 m. Bezpo\u015brednio na trasie nie ma schroniska ani mo\u017cliwo\u015bci zakupu jedzenia. G\u00f3rna cz\u0119\u015b\u0107 szlaku jest stroma i skalista. Cz\u0119\u015b\u0107 trasy podlega sezonowemu zamkni\u0119ciu TANAP.\n\nCzas i suma podej\u015b\u0107 dotycz\u0105 ca\u0142ej p\u0119tli z powrotem przez Jamsk\u00e9 pleso. Dystans pozostaje niepotwierdzony.","trail_id":10,"description":"Wymagaj\u0105ca wysokog\u00f3rska p\u0119tla z Tri studni\u010dky na szczyt Kriv\u00e1\u0148a. Trasa prowadzi na szczyt o wysoko\u015bci 2494 m, a nast\u0119pnie schodzi przez Jamsk\u00e9 pleso i wraca do Tri studni\u010dky."},{"lang":"ua","name":"\u041a\u0440\u0438\u0432\u0430\u043d\u044c \u0437 Tri studni\u010dky","notes":"\u041d\u0430 \u043c\u0430\u0440\u0448\u0440\u0443\u0442 \u0441\u043b\u0456\u0434 \u043f\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434\u0431\u0430\u0447\u0438\u0442\u0438 \u043f\u0440\u0438\u0431\u043b\u0438\u0437\u043d\u043e 6 \u0433\u043e\u0434\u0438\u043d. \u041d\u0430\u0431\u0456\u0440 \u0432\u0438\u0441\u043e\u0442\u0438 \u0441\u0442\u0430\u043d\u043e\u0432\u0438\u0442\u044c \u0431\u043b\u0438\u0437\u044c\u043a\u043e 1354 \u043c. \u0411\u0435\u0437\u043f\u043e\u0441\u0435\u0440\u0435\u0434\u043d\u044c\u043e \u043d\u0430 \u043c\u0430\u0440\u0448\u0440\u0443\u0442\u0456 \u043d\u0435\u043c\u0430\u0454 \u0433\u0456\u0440\u0441\u044c\u043a\u043e\u0433\u0